37851>>>>>>>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
37851>>>>>>>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
37851>>>>>>>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37852>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
37853>>>>>>>>>
37853>>>>>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
37856>>>>>>>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent lookup from a Zoom
37856>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
