37857>>>>>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromMain)
37860>>>>>>>>>                // If from main, this is a probably a main-file lookup from a Zoom
37860>>>>>>>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37861>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
37862>>>>>>>>>
37862>>>>>>>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37862>>>>>>>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
37862>>>>>>>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
37862>>>>>>>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37863>>>>>>>>>
37863>>>>>>>>>        Case End
37863>>>>>>>>>
37863>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
